283
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:13,120
The spirits?

284
00:15:13,980 --> 00:15:14,420
Oh.

285
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:16,240
Ghosts?

286
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:16,800
Spirits?

287
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:17,700
