Super nasty.

322
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:30,700
Be careful, Fushi.

323
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:33,460
Have a backup body ready just in case.

324
00:16:33,580 --> 00:16:35,220
Yeah, and you take care of the others.

325
00:16:35,380 --> 00:16:35,760
I will.

326
