334
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:35,240
Oh my, it's an album.

335
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:37,720
Well, wanna look?

336
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:39,660
No, you don't?

337
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,340
I'm so sorry.

338
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:43,340
She's been acting so selfish lately.

339
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:46,080
Well, what do you want, Mizuha?

340
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:54,400
Hmm, what's that?

341
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,400
You want Fushi?

342
00:17:55,940 --> 00:17:57,560
Whatever shall I do with you?

343
00:17:57,700 --> 00:18:00,120
There is no real Fushi, Mizuha.

344
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:04,760
You see, what's in front of you is the body of a person I once met long ago.

345
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,480
Is that really what you want?

346
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:07,860
You're real.

347
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:12,980
You're here in front of me, and you're even talking to me.

348
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:14,120
Hey, knocker.

349
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:17,100
