351
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:30,120
Until it finally becomes a paradise, Mizuha's mind and soul will both need to remain here.

352
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:37,840
Mizuha, is that what you honestly want?

353
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:38,400
You really believe?

354
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:40,120
What's your true wish?

355
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,920
I know that everyone wants you to come back.

356
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:43,880
Me too.

357
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:45,700
Alright.

358
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:49,580
So then tell me, if I were to die, would you cry for me?

359
00:18:51,280 --> 00:18:51,800
Yeah.

360
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:53,640
You liar.

361
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:56,540
You know full well that you've never cried before.

362
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:59,040
Yes, I have.

363
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:01,100
You mean the time you became a sea turtle?

364
00:19:01,420 --> 00:19:03,220
They don't count as human tears.

365
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:05,140
I can't trust you.

366
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:07,580
I'm afraid nothing you say rings true to me.

367
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:10,280
How can I ever believe a word you say?

368
00:19:10,620 --> 00:19:14,540
I mean, you're always prepared to run away at a moment's notice.

369
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,820
Mizuha, do you know I envy you?

370
00:19:22,280 --> 00:19:26,780
You've been Mizuha since the day you were born, and you've always been allowed to be Mizuha.

371
00:19:26,780 --> 00:19:29,940
Yes, but only as my mother's trophy.

372
00:19:30,600 --> 00:19:31,500
That's not true.

373
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:37,100
Izumi tried to raise you as a person that she could be proud of, and maybe that upset you.

374
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:39,860
But she... she honestly loved you.

375
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:41,300
That much is certain.

376
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:42,560
Liar.

377
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:44,080
You're full of shit.

378
00:19:44,300 --> 00:19:45,980
You can't even prove it to me.

379
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:47,900
I can, with that photo album.

380
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:50,720
Take a look, and it'll prove your mom loves you.

381
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:01,140
The knocker caused amnesia for Izumi.

382
00:20:01,460 --> 00:20:02,580
Those painful memories.

383
00:20:03,460 --> 00:20:05,120
You were always involved in them.

384
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:09,220
But she never wanted to forget those days she spent with you.

385
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:10,900
She held on to them.

386
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:19,580
I remember this.

387
00:20:20,580 --> 00:20:21,780
All of it.

388
00:20:22,300 --> 00:20:23,660
I remember.

389
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:30,000
What are you doing showing me these photos, Fushi?

390
00:20:30,380 --> 00:20:32,080
These are painful memories.

391
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:34,720
You really shouldn't have looked at this photo album.

392
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,160
Now then, it's about time we got started.

393
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,360
Hey, stop that!

394
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,160
Let me go!

395
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:40,360
Let me go!

396
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:46,240
Happy birthday to you.

397
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:49,380
Happy birthday to you.

398
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:52,760
Happy birthday, dear Mizuha.

399
00:20:53,660 --> 00:20:56,720
Happy birthday to you.

400
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:12,100
Um, so, I know this might be rude to say in front of your family,

401
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:14,660
