408
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:33,660
We worked together to find you because all of us care a lot about you!

409
00:21:33,740 --> 00:21:35,300
Please stop shouting at me, Hana.

410
00:21:35,760 --> 00:21:36,440
It's annoying.

411
00:21:37,220 --> 00:21:38,500
Don't change the subject.

412
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,800
Why do you need to be down here?

413
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,420
