418
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:57,100
Well, you're not a doctor, so I'm not listening to you.

419
00:21:57,300 --> 00:21:58,020
Copy that!

420
00:21:58,860 --> 00:22:02,560
Mizuha, I have no idea what your life was like growing up.

421
00:22:03,220 --> 00:22:05,940
And it might be impossible for me to give you what you need,

422
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:08,880
