426
00:22:16,740 --> 00:22:19,880
Um, pardon me, but it really smells of stagnant water down here.

427
00:22:20,340 --> 00:22:20,620
Huh?

428
00:22:20,820 --> 00:22:25,200
And furthermore, I have to add, that cake looks absolutely disgusting.

429
00:22:25,640 --> 00:22:27,500
I recommend you leave before you stink.

430
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:29,760
